   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Orbit Lock\n\nMoons ride tilted, shrinking orbits into a core that bursts into a ring flash, and the logo springs into place. The placeholder lockup is a stand-in: a host swaps in its own logo by editing the .ol-logo element.\n\nCategory: logo-stings. Length: 2.6 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A tech, AI or infrastructure product needs an opener or closer where the logo arrives out of a small physical event.\n- You want a sting with a clear impact beat to sync a sound hit to, at 1 s.\n\nAvoid when:\n- Several partner logos should arrive together as a group.\n- The reveal should feel cinematic and calm: use anamorphic-flare or spotlight.\n\nVariables:\n- text (string): Wordmark, default \"studio\"\n- moons (number, 1-8): Moons, default 3\n- background_color (color): Background, default \"#111111\"\n- core_color (color): Core, default \"#E5322D\"\n- moon_color (color): Moons, default \"#FFFFFF\"\n- flash_color (color): Flash, default \"#FFFFFF\"\n- tilt (number, 0-85): Tilt, default 64\n- speed (number, 0.25-3): Speed, default 1\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
